 "campaign_json": "{\"type\": \"regular\", \"recipients\": {\"list_id\": \"d1ad6c7464\"}, \"settings\": {\"subject_line\": \"The spring sale that starts in November\", \"preview_text\": \"What to sort this winter so a spring sale runs smoothly, plus a cottage in Palnackie\", \"title\": \"Your Compass Guide, November 2026, Issue 7\", \"from_name\": \"Duncan Ure\", \"reply_to\": \"duncan@compass-estates.co.uk\"}}",
 "content_json": "{\"html\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\"><meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\"><meta http-equiv=\\\"X-UA-Compatible\\\" content=\\\"IE=edge\\\"><title>Your Compass Guide, Issue 7</title>\\n<style>\\n@media only screen and (max-width:600px){ .px{padding-left:24px !important;padding-right:24px !important;} .masthead{font-size:28px !important;} .h2{font-size:22px !important;} }\\n</style></head>\\n<body style=\\\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#363c52;\\\">\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#363c52;\\\"><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"padding:0;\\\">\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"660\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"max-width:660px;width:100%;\\\">\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#363c52;padding:40px 40px 32px 40px;\\\">\\n<a href=\\\"https://www.compass-estates.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://mcusercontent.com/227242e507c61fc419062b187/images/62effc1b-fed9-f8f0-b9e4-ec6b0ab3b09f.png\\\" alt=\\\"Compass Estates\\\" width=\\\"180\\\" style=\\\"display:block;max-width:180px;height:auto;margin:0 auto;border:0;\\\"></a>\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:28px;\\\"><tr><td style=\\\"border-top:2px solid #e0b940;font-size:0;line-height:0;\\\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table>\\n<h1 class=\\\"masthead\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:700;color:#f2f3f0;margin:28px 0 10px 0;text-align:center;line-height:1.2;\\\">Your Compass Guide</h1>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#f2f3f0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin:0 0 14px 0;text-align:center;opacity:0.75;\\\">Property insight from Duncan Ure, Compass Estates</p>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#e0b940;margin:0 0 28px 0;text-align:center;letter-spacing:1px;\\\">Issue 7 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; November 2026</p>\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"><tr><td style=\\\"border-top:2px solid #e0b940;font-size:0;line-height:0;\\\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td style=\\\"background-color:#f2f3f0;padding:0;\\\">\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\">\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:48px 40px 0 40px;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#363c52;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin:0 0 16px 0;opacity:0.5;padding:0;\\\">In this issue</p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"h2\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#363c52;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 28px 0;\\\">Selling in spring? Use the winter well</h2>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">If you are thinking of selling next year, spring is the obvious time to aim for. The sales that run smoothly in March and April are usually the ones where the groundwork was done over the winter. Very little of it costs money. It mostly takes time, and the dark evenings give you plenty of that.</p><p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">Start with the paperwork. If you have extended the house, converted the loft or added a conservatory, find the building warrant and the council&rsquo;s sign-off for the work now. The buyer&rsquo;s solicitor will ask for them, and if one is missing, putting it right can take a while. Gather any guarantees for windows, damp proofing or roof work too, along with the boiler&rsquo;s service history.</p><p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">Next, think about the Home Report. It has to be no more than 12 weeks old when your home goes on the market, so there is no point commissioning it now for an April launch. What you can do now is deal with the small things a surveyor is likely to note: a dripping gutter, a window that sticks, a slipped slate. A short list of minor items reads far better to a buyer than a long one.</p><p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">Then clear out. The loft, the garage and the spare room are the jobs everyone leaves until last, and they are much easier done slowly over a few months than in the fortnight before the photographs.</p><p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">Finally, get a realistic figure to plan around. A valuation over the winter tells you what your home is likely to sell for and which of these jobs are worth doing first. There is no obligation and no rush, and it gives you a few months to act on what we find.</p>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:16px 40px 48px 40px;\\\">\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 28px 0;\\\"><tr>\\n<td valign=\\\"middle\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 18px 0 0;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://mcusercontent.com/227242e507c61fc419062b187/images/6dc15208-ea04-851c-562d-f3f93b98f8de.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Duncan Ure, Compass Estates\\\" width=\\\"72\\\" height=\\\"72\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:50%;border:0;\\\"></td>\\n<td valign=\\\"middle\\\"><p style=\\\"font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 4px 0;line-height:1.3;\\\">Duncan Ure</p>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#363c52;margin:0;opacity:0.6;line-height:1.5;\\\">Director, Compass Estates<br>Dumfries &amp; Galloway</p></td>\\n</tr></table>\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto;border-collapse:collapse;\\\"><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#363c52;border-radius:2px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://duncanure.co.uk/valuation\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;background-color:#363c52;color:#f2f3f0;font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:2px;border:2px solid #363c52;\\\">Book a valuation</a></td></tr></table>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td style=\\\"padding:0 40px;\\\"><table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"><tr><td style=\\\"border-top:2px solid #e0b940;font-size:0;line-height:0;\\\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:48px 40px 24px 40px;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#363c52;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin:0 0 16px 0;opacity:0.5;padding:0;\\\">Featured listing</p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"h2\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#363c52;line-height:1.35;margin:0;\\\">A cottage with character in Palnackie</h2>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 40px 28px 40px;\\\">\\n<a href=\\\"https://www.compass-estates.co.uk/property/784/3-bed-end-terraced-house-for-sale-poets-corner-palnackie/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://compassestates.10ninety.co.uk/PublicPropertyMedia/DisplayImage/18126?cropToFill=false&amp;useLargePhoto=true\\\" alt=\\\"Poets Corner, a traditional end-terraced cottage in Palnackie\\\" width=\\\"580\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:580px;height:auto;border:0;\\\"></a>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 40px 48px 40px;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">Poets Corner is a traditional end-terraced cottage in Palnackie, a small harbour village a short drive from Dalbeattie and Castle Douglas. The character is in the house itself. The living room has a bare stone wall and a wood burning stove under a timber lintel, and there is a separate dining room alongside.</p><p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">The kitchen has timber units, a Belfast sink and a Rayburn, with French doors out to the garden and a sun room beyond. There is a WC on the ground floor. Upstairs are three bedrooms and a panelled bathroom with a bath and a separate shower.</p><p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">The rear garden is enclosed, lawned and planted, with a timber summerhouse that would suit a studio or a quiet place to work. Solar panels are fitted to the roof, parking is on the street and the council tax band is C.</p><p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">Offers over &pound;180,000.</p><p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">View the full listing and photos on <a href=\\\"https://www.compass-estates.co.uk/property/784/3-bed-end-terraced-house-for-sale-poets-corner-palnackie/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color:#363c52;text-decoration:underline;\\\">compass-estates.co.uk</a>.</p><p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">Thinking of selling something similar? Book a free valuation and find out what your property could achieve.</p>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td style=\\\"padding:0 40px;\\\"><table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"><tr><td style=\\\"border-top:2px solid #e0b940;font-size:0;line-height:0;\\\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"padding:48px 40px;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#363c52;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin:0 0 16px 0;opacity:0.5;padding:0;text-align:center;\\\">What to expect</p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"h2\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#363c52;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 24px 0;text-align:center;\\\">A valuation from Compass Estates isn't a pitch</h2>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#363c52;margin:0 auto 32px auto;text-align:center;max-width:480px;\\\">It takes about 45 minutes. I will look at the property, give you an honest view of what it would sell for in the current market, and explain exactly what the marketing would look like. No obligation to proceed. Most sellers find it useful whether they go ahead or not.</p>\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto;border-collapse:collapse;\\\"><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#363c52;border-radius:2px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://duncanure.co.uk/valuation\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;background-color:#363c52;color:#f2f3f0;font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:2px;border:2px solid #363c52;\\\">Book your valuation</a></td></tr></table>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td style=\\\"padding:0 40px;\\\"><table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"><tr><td style=\\\"border-top:2px solid #e0b940;font-size:0;line-height:0;\\\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:48px 40px 28px 40px;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#363c52;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin:0 0 16px 0;opacity:0.5;padding:0;\\\">From the blog</p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"h2\\\" style=\\\"font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#363c52;line-height:1.35;margin:0;\\\">Should you sell before you buy? The Scottish answer</h2>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" style=\\\"padding:0 40px 48px 40px;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;\\\">Once you have seen somewhere you love, the instinct is to secure it first and sell afterwards. In Scotland that order carries real risk, from running two mortgages to the Additional Dwelling Supplement.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#363c52;margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0;margin-bottom:28px;\\\">This post explains why selling first usually leaves you in the stronger position, and the situations where buying first can still work.</p>\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto;border-collapse:collapse;\\\"><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#363c52;border-radius:2px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://duncanure.co.uk/blog/sell-before-buying-scotland\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;background-color:#363c52;color:#f2f3f0;font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:2px;border:2px solid #363c52;\\\">Read the full post</a></td></tr></table>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td style=\\\"padding:0 40px;\\\"><table role=\\\"presentation\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\"><tr><td style=\\\"border-top:2px solid #e0b940;font-size:0;line-height:0;\\\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"padding:48px 40px;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#363c52;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin:0 0 16px 0;opacity:0.5;padding:0;text-align:center;\\\">Our latest listings</p>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#363c52;margin:0 auto 32px auto;text-align:center;max-width:480px;\\\">Browse everything we have on the market right now in Dumfries &amp; Galloway and beyond.</p>\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto;border-collapse:collapse;\\\"><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#363c52;border-radius:2px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://www.compass-estates.co.uk/sales/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;background-color:#363c52;color:#f2f3f0;font-family:Lora,Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:2px;border:2px solid #363c52;\\\">Have a look</a></td></tr></table>\\n</td></tr>\\n</table>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr><td class=\\\"px\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#363c52;border-top:3px solid #e0b940;padding:40px 40px 36px 40px;\\\">\\n<table role=\\\"presentation\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 auto 32px auto;border-collapse:collapse;\\\"><tr><td style=\\\"padding:0 10px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61572942736770\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://cdn-images.mailchimp.com/icons/social-block-v3/block-icons-v3/facebook-outline-light-40.png\\\" alt=\\\"Facebook\\\" width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"36\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:36px;height:36px;border:0;\\\"></a></td><td style=\\\"padding:0 10px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/duncanure_compassestates/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://cdn-images.mailchimp.com/icons/social-block-v3/block-icons-v3/instagram-outline-light-40.png\\\" alt=\\\"Instagram\\\" width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"36\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:36px;height:36px;border:0;\\\"></a></td><td style=\\\"padding:0 10px;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://www.compass-estates.co.uk\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><img src=\\\"https://cdn-images.mailchimp.com/icons/social-block-v3/block-icons-v3/website-outline-light-40.png\\\" alt=\\\"Website\\\" width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"36\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:36px;height:36px;border:0;\\\"></a></td><td style=\\\"padding:0 10px;\\\"><a href=\\\"mailto:duncan@compass-estates.co.uk\\\"><img src=\\\"https://cdn-images.mailchimp.com/icons/social-block-v3/block-icons-v3/email-outline-light-40.png\\\" alt=\\\"Email\\\" width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"36\\\" style=\\\"display:block;width:36px;height:36px;border:0;\\\"></a></td></tr></table>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#f2f3f0;margin:0 auto 12px auto;text-align:center;opacity:0.7;max-width:460px;\\\">You're getting this email because at some point you asked to hear from Compass Estates. Perhaps through our website, one of our listings, a free valuation, or one of our local posts.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#f2f3f0;margin:0 auto 24px auto;text-align:center;opacity:0.7;max-width:460px;\\\">We'll only ever share useful property updates and news from right here in Dumfries &amp; Galloway and across Scotland. If that's still of interest, great. If not, you can unsubscribe anytime below.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#f2f3f0;margin:0 0 28px 0;text-align:center;opacity:0.7;\\\">Thanks for staying connected,<br><strong>Duncan</strong></p>\\n<p style=\\\"font-family:'Source Sans 3','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#f2f3f0;margin:0;text-align:center;opacity:0.6;\\\">Copyright &copy; 2026 Compass Estates Group. All rights reserved.<br>Compass Estates, Castle Douglas, Dumfries &amp; Galloway<br>Compass Estates Group, Alba Innovation Centre, The Alba Campus,<br>Livingston, West Lothian EH54 7GA<br><br><a href=\\\"*|UNSUB|*\\\" style=\\\"color:#f2f3f0;text-decoration:underline;\\\">Unsubscribe</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <a href=\\\"*|UPDATE_PROFILE|*\\\" style=\\\"color:#f2f3f0;text-decoration:underline;\\\">Update preferences</a></p>\\n</td></tr>\\n</table>\\n</td></tr></table>\\n</body></html>\\n\"}",
